    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n99814" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεγγ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>draw near</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.23.8
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>
