					Id.
					<u>Mus.</u>
					p.99
				</span></i>
			 K.; abs. (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ σοφίᾳ</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ir.</u>
				p.74
